-- title:
--   Original finite-cap centred-square Gaussian cells have pairwise orthogonal products
-- statement:
--   Distinct original postpayment predictable Gaussian compensated-square cells are L2-orthogonal. Earlier-cell factors and later-cell Hessian coefficients are measurable with respect to the original right-continuous filtration, and the conditional mean of the later centred square is zero.
-- source:
--   Required original-process input to finite-cap gB28 variance bound, which closes gB24 and gB20.

import Mathlib
